{"id":"guerra","lemma":"guerra","pos":"noun","rank":307,"glosses":["war, warfare"],"ipa":"/ˈɡera/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"guerras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-guerra.wav","examples":[{"text":"Podemos ganar esta guerra.","en":"We can win this war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523505"},{"text":"¿Por qué sigue habiendo guerras en el mundo?","en":"Why are there still wars in the world?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689581"},{"text":"La guerra terminó en 1945.","en":"The war ended in 1945.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460813"},{"text":"Creemos que no debería haber más guerras.","en":"We think that there should be no more wars."},{"text":"La guerra explotó en 1939.","en":"War broke out in 1939.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553694"}]}